Track acknowledged configure state in RoleLastAcked<S> (MultiCache) across
xdg_surface::ack_configure, commits, null-buffer unmaps, and destruction, and post
xdg_surface::Error::UnconfiguredBuffer (3) from ToplevelSurface/PopupSurface
pre_commit_hook when a buffer is attached before a configure acknowledgement.

W-SM-18 / P6: pre-patch Smithay checked attributes.configured in post-commit
ensure_configured and posted xdg_surface::Error::NotConstructed (1) instead of
xdg_surface::Error::UnconfiguredBuffer (3), and left last_acked outside MultiCache.
Temporary ensure_configured methods remain as non-erroring compatibility helpers until
crates/infynitae-wayland removes its calls in batch 4.

Upstream status: fixed in Smithay/smithay PR #1817 (commit 641d2ad, 2025-09-17); not in
pinned smithay 0.7.0.

